{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00115","headline":"石淙 · 中宗皇帝","name":"石淙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三阳本是标灵纪，二室由来独擅名。\n霞衣霞锦千般状，云峰云岫百重生。\n水炫珠光遇泉客，岩悬石镜厌山精。\n永愿乾坤符睿算，长居膝下属欢情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"中宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}